# The smallest tape that exercises the whole chain: a keystroke reaches the
# PTY, the shell echoes it, the pump sees a distinct frame, and every sink
# writes a file. If this one breaks, nothing else is worth debugging yet.

Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 60
Set Framerate 50

Type "macchina"
Enter
Sleep 1s
